fix md all nvt temp 348.6125 348.6125 200
run 1000000
unfix md
# cool step 7/8: 323.38125 K
# D48 lateral box at 323.38125 K (bulk cooling density 0.850419 g/cm3): Lx 64.2043, Ly 64.2043 A; z unchanged
change_box all x final 13.2409787752 77.4452391648 y final 13.2409787752 77.4452391648 remap units box
fix md all nvt temp 323.38125 323.38125 200
run 1000000
unfix md
# cool step 8/8: 298.15 K
# D48 lateral box at 298.15 K (bulk cooling density 0.859859 g/cm3): Lx 63.9684, Ly 63.9684 A; z unchanged
change_box all x final 13.3588900441 77.3273278959 y final 13.3588900441 77.3273278959 remap units box
fix md all nvt temp 298.15 298.15 200
run 1000000
unfix md
undump cool
write_data cooled.data
write_restart cooled.restart

